@startuml
title Prefect Integration Sequence - GPWCF to Native Prefect Binding
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Root Flow Run" as Root
participant "Stage Parent Flow/Deployment" as StageFlow
participant "Step Subflow" as StepSub
participant "SPU Task" as SPUTask
participant "GPWCF Domain Contract" as GW

Root -> StageFlow : run_deployment(as_subflow=True)
StageFlow -> StepSub : invoke_step dispatch Task
StepSub -> SPUTask : execute SPU as native Task
SPUTask --> GW : return SPUExecutionResult (not Prefect State)
GW --> StepSub : domain result preserved
StepSub --> StageFlow : Step result
StageFlow --> Root : Stage result via persist_result=True

note right of Root : Domain identities != Prefect operational identities
Prefect State = operational evidence, not domain result
GPWCF contracts remain runtime-independent

@enduml